# The static image (Dockerfile.static) only needs the exported HTML.
# Ignore everything, then allow exports/ (minus its logs) to keep the
# Railway build context tiny — no .git, .venv, data/, jupyter_notebooks/, etc.
*
!exports/
exports/_*.log
!app/
!app/**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!helper_lib/
!helper_lib/*.py
!models/
!models/assignment2_cnn.pth
